---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Weekly Thing
description: A weekly collection of interesting links, ideas, and observations from across the internet, curated by Jamie Thingelstad.
permalink: /
---
{% set latestIssues = collections.issuesByDate %}
{% set latest = latestIssues[0] %}

{# ── Hero ── #}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">A newsletter by Jamie Thingelstad</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Weekly Thing</h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">Every weekend, one curious person sifts through the internet and sends you the things worth your time. Technology, culture, the indie web, and whatever else refuses to be ignored.</p>
    <div class="hero-subscribe">
      {% set subscribeId = "hero" %}
      {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
    </div>
    <p class="hero-proof">Free, every weekend. {{ latest.data.number }} issues and counting since 2017.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── What this actually is ── #}
<section class="section value-prop">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="value-grid">
      <div class="value-main">
        <h2>Not an algorithm. Not a feed.<br>Just one person paying attention.</h2>
        <p>Every week, Jamie reads widely and deeply across the internet — from Ars Technica to personal blogs you've never heard of, from the New York Times to someone's weekend project on GitHub. The result is a newsletter that connects dots nobody else is connecting.</p>
        <p>Each link comes with context: why it matters, what's interesting about it, and how it fits into the bigger picture. It's commentary, not just aggregation.</p>
        <p>And you can read it knowing your privacy is preserved. No tracking pixels, no click tracking, no data harvesting. Just words in your inbox.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-stats">
        <div class="value-stat">
          <span class="value-stat-number">{{ archiveStats.totalLinks | numberFormat }}</span>
          <span class="value-stat-label">curated links across {{ latest.data.number }} issues</span>
        </div>
        <div class="value-stat">
          <span class="value-stat-number">{{ archiveStats.totalWords | numberFormat }}</span>
          <span class="value-stat-label">words of commentary and context</span>
        </div>
        <div class="value-stat">
          <span class="value-stat-number">{{ archiveStats.uniqueDomainsTotal | numberFormat }}</span>
          <span class="value-stat-label">unique sources linked</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── What Readers Say ── #}
<section class="section reader-quotes">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">What Readers Say</h2>

    <div class="survey-stats-row">
      <div class="survey-stat">
        <span class="survey-stat-number">{{ survey.stats.recommendationScore.value }}%</span>
        <span class="survey-stat-label">{{ survey.stats.recommendationScore.label }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="survey-stat">
        <span class="survey-stat-number">{{ survey.stats.readWholeIssue.value }}%</span>
        <span class="survey-stat-label">{{ survey.stats.readWholeIssue.label }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="survey-stat">
        <span class="survey-stat-number">{{ survey.stats.longTimeReaders.value }}%</span>
        <span class="survey-stat-label">{{ survey.stats.longTimeReaders.label }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feeling-words">
      <p class="feeling-words-intro">Readers say the newsletter makes them feel:</p>
      <div class="feeling-words-cloud">
        {%- for word in survey.feelingWords %}
        <span class="feeling-word feeling-word-{{ word.frequency }}">{{ word.word }}</span>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quotes-grid">
      {% for quote in quotes %}
      {% if quote.featured %}
      <blockquote class="quote-card">
        <p>{{ quote.text }}</p>
      </blockquote>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Mid-page subscribe CTA ── #}
<section class="section inline-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="inline-cta-text">Join them. Free, every weekend.</p>
    {% set subscribeId = "mid1" %}
    {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Who writes this ── #}
<section class="section about-author">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <img src="/img/jamie-thingelstad.jpg" alt="Jamie Thingelstad" class="about-photo" loading="lazy" width="200" height="200">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2>Who's behind this?</h2>
        <p>Jamie Thingelstad is CTO of <a href="https://www.spscommerce.com">SPS Commerce</a> by day, but the Weekly Thing isn't about his day job. It's the output of a restless curiosity that ranges from AI and the indie web to escape rooms, vinyl records, and whatever Wikipedia rabbit hole he fell into this week.</p>
        <p>A single issue might cover agentic engineering, a cheeseburger review, an Ethereum deep dive, and photos from a family trip to Duluth. That range is the point — and it's what keeps readers coming back.</p>
        <p><a href="/about/">More about Jamie &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Voice: actual quotes from the newsletter ── #}
<section class="section voice-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">How It Sounds</h2>
    <div class="voice-grid">
      <blockquote class="voice-card">
        <p>"At our cabin we have a record player and more often than makes sense I think to myself when playing a record how novel it is that no company, no algorithm, no system knows that we are listening to the Foo Fighters right now. It fills me with joy actually."</p>
        <footer><a href="/archive/320/">#320 &mdash; Octopus, Agentic, Voyager</a></footer>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote class="voice-card">
        <p>"Number one life hack? Ditch social media entirely; learn how to use an RSS reader."</p>
        <footer><a href="/archive/343/">#343 &mdash; Commune, Chaos, Renaissance</a></footer>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote class="voice-card">
        <p>"We have entered a time where the cost of content creation will trend to zero. I believe that the provenance and identity of content creation will be increasingly important."</p>
        <footer><a href="/archive/250/">#250 &mdash; LLM, Shanghai, Wing</a></footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Latest Issue ── #}
{% if latest %}
<section class="section latest-issue">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Latest Issue</h2>
    <article class="latest-issue-card">
      <div class="latest-issue-meta">
        <span class="issue-number">#{{ latest.data.number }}</span>
        <time datetime="{{ latest.data.publish_date | dateFormat('iso') }}">{{ latest.data.publish_date | dateFormat }}</time>
      </div>
      <h3 class="latest-issue-title">
        <a href="/archive/{{ latest.data.number }}/">{{ latest.data.subject }}</a>
      </h3>
      {% if latest.data.description %}
      <p class="latest-issue-description">{{ latest.data.description }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% set toc = latest.content | extractToc %}
      {% if toc.length > 0 %}
      <div class="latest-issue-toc-inline">
        <ol>
          {% for heading in toc | slice(0, 8) %}
          <li>{{ heading.text }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
          {% if toc.length > 8 %}
          <li class="toc-more">+ {{ toc.length - 8 }} more sections</li>
          {% endif %}
        </ol>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <a href="/archive/{{ latest.data.number }}/" class="btn btn-primary">Read this issue &rarr;</a>
    </article>
    <p class="section-cta"><a href="/archive/">Browse the full archive ({{ latest.data.number }} issues) &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# ── Mid-page subscribe CTA ── #}
<section class="section inline-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="inline-cta-text">Curious? Get it in your inbox every weekend.</p>
    {% set subscribeId = "mid2" %}
    {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Membership ── #}
<section class="section supporting-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Membership</h2>
    <p>The Weekly Thing is free for everyone, always. Members contribute to a nonprofit selected each year — <strong>100% of fees are donated</strong>.</p>
    {% if support.current %}
    <p>This year, we're supporting <strong><a href="{{ support.current.url }}">{{ support.current.nonprofit }}</a></strong>.
    {% if stats.amount_raised > 0 %} ${{ stats.amount_raised | round }} raised so far.{% endif %}
    {% if stats.premium_subscriber_count > 0 %} {{ stats.premium_subscriber_count }} members.{% endif %}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
    <p><a href="/members/" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn more &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── Final CTA ── #}
<section class="section footer-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Start reading this weekend</h2>
    <p>Join {{ ((stats.subscriber_count / 100) | round * 100) | numberFormat }}+ readers who get the Weekly Thing every weekend. No spam, no tracking, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    {% set subscribeId = "footer" %}
    {% include "partials/subscribe-form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
